; badgencm.h86 - intentionally malformed DR hex record (embeds the letter
; 'h' where a hex digit is expected) so cpm86_gencmd reports "INVALID HEX
; DIGIT" (a real error). Used to verify the wrapper removes badgencm.cmd
; instead of leaving a bad file behind.
:0A0100000E0h0000000000000000FF
:00000001FF
